# Copy to .env and fill in:
#
# THEOKIT_API_KEY — any non-empty string. Used by the SDK for cloud
# catalog reads; not strictly required for chat against Anthropic/OpenAI
# directly. Set to "local" if you're not using Theo cloud.
THEOKIT_API_KEY=local

# Provider key — pick ONE. The SDK auto-detects which one is set.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...

# Override the model. The knob is `THEOCODE_MODEL`. Every environment knob is declared in
# `packages/agent/src/config/env-knobs.ts` — that registry is the source of truth, and it names
# the reader and the default of each one. A `.theocode/config.toml` in the project is the file
# layer these override.
# THEOCODE_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini
